sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EM as Emir motoru
    participant K as Kafka trade.events
    participant L as TradeEventsListener
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    EM->>K: ORDER_FILLED (key=orderId, event_id=E1)
    K->>L: E1 (offset 41)
    L->>DB: BEGIN · INSERT inbox(E1) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING → 1 satır
    L->>DB: SAVEPOINT · capture (provizyon + bakiye + ledger + outbox) · COMMIT
    Note over L,K: Offset commit'ten ÖNCE pod öldü (deploy, OOM)
    K->>L: E1 tekrar (offset 41, başka pod)
    L->>DB: INSERT inbox(E1) → 0 satır (çakışma)
    L-->>K: DUPLICATE · offset commit · etki yok

    EM->>K: ORDER_CANCELLED (E2) ... sonra ORDER_FILLED (E3) aynı emir
    K->>L: E2 → APPLIED (release)
    K->>L: E3 → inbox(E3) yeni, ama provizyon RELEASED
    L->>DB: ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT · inbox(E3) = CONFLICT · COMMIT
    Note over L: ERROR log + inbox_messages_total{outcome=CONFLICT}<br/>Tekrar teslim (E1) sessiz, gerçek çelişki (E3) alarm
